### Work IQ REST API — quick manual tests (VS Code REST Client extension)
###
### 1. Paste a delegated access token below (scope: api://workiq.svc.cloud.microsoft/WorkIQAgent.Ask).
###    You can grab one from `npm start` logs or from the Microsoft Entra token flow.
### 2. Run "Create conversation", copy the returned id into @conversationId.
### 3. Run the chat requests.

@base = https://workiq.svc.cloud.microsoft/rest
@token = PASTE_DELEGATED_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@conversationId = PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID_HERE

### Create a conversation
POST {{base}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Send a chat message (synchronous)
POST {{base}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "text": "What meeting do I have at 9 AM tomorrow morning?"
  },
  "locationHint": {
    "timeZone": "America/New_York"
  }
}

### Send a chat message with a SharePoint/OneDrive file as context
POST {{base}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "text": "Summarize this document for me."
  },
  "locationHint": {
    "timeZone": "America/New_York"
  },
  "contextualResources": {
    "files": [
      {
        "uri": "https://contoso.sharepoint.com/sites/Engineering/Shared%20Documents/Specs/Business-Model.docx"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Send a chat message with web search grounding turned off (single turn)
POST {{base}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "text": "Summarize my recent emails about the Q3 launch."
  },
  "locationHint": {
    "timeZone": "America/New_York"
  },
  "contextualResources": {
    "webSearchOptions": {
      "isEnabled": false
    }
  }
}

### Send a chat message on the streamed endpoint
POST {{base}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/chatOverStream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": {
    "text": "What meeting do I have at 9 AM tomorrow morning?"
  },
  "locationHint": {
    "timeZone": "America/New_York"
  }
}


### ===========================================================================
### Work IQ A2A (Agent-to-Agent protocol, JSON-RPC 2.0) — Demo 3
### Same delegated token as above. `A2A-Version: 1.0` selects the v1.0 method
### names; omit it and the server falls back to v0.3 (message/send, tasks/get…).
### Copy the returned task.id / task.contextId into the variables below.
### ===========================================================================

@a2a = https://workiq.svc.cloud.microsoft/a2a
@a2aContextId = PASTE_CONTEXT_ID_HERE
@a2aTaskId = PASTE_TASK_ID_HERE

### A2A — discover the Agent Card
GET {{a2a}}/.well-known/agent-card.json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
A2A-Version: 1.0

### A2A — SendMessage (blocking; answer is in result.task.artifacts[].parts[].text)
POST {{a2a}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
A2A-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "SendMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "messageId": "{{$guid}}",
      "parts": [{ "text": "What meetings do I have today?" }],
      "metadata": { "Location": { "timeZone": "America/New_York", "timeZoneOffset": -240 } }
    }
  }
}

### A2A — SendMessage, multi-turn (reuse contextId from the previous result)
POST {{a2a}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
A2A-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "SendMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "messageId": "{{$guid}}",
      "contextId": "{{a2aContextId}}",
      "parts": [{ "text": "Which of those is the longest?" }]
    }
  }
}

### A2A — SendStreamingMessage (SSE: task → statusUpdate → artifactUpdate… → statusUpdate COMPLETED)
POST {{a2a}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
A2A-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "SendStreamingMessage",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "role": "ROLE_USER",
      "messageId": "{{$guid}}",
      "parts": [{ "text": "Summarize my unread emails." }]
    }
  }
}

### A2A — GetTask
POST {{a2a}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
A2A-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "GetTask", "params": { "id": "{{a2aTaskId}}" } }

### A2A — CancelTask (a completed task returns error -32002 TaskNotCancelableError)
POST {{a2a}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
A2A-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "method": "CancelTask", "params": { "id": "{{a2aTaskId}}" } }
